Architecture: amd64
Depends: libqt6core6 | libqt6core6t64, libqt6gui6 | libqt6gui6t64, libqt6widgets6 | libqt6widgets6t64, libqt6opengl6 | libqt6opengl6t64, libqt6svg6, libqt6network6 | libqt6network6t64, libgl1, libtiff6 | libtiff5
Description: Qt6-based image processing tool with JSON-history support
 ImageEditor is a versatile Qt6 image processing tool for interactive and
 batch image manipulation. Features include lasso cut, polygon selection,
 layer transforms (move, rotate, scale, mirror, perspective warp, cage warp),
 AI inpainting (LaMa/PatchMatch), BigTIFF/HDF5 pyramid viewers, and a
 JSON-based project history for reproducible workflows.
Maintainer: Hartmut Mohlberg <h.mohlberg@fz-juelich.de>
